# Ignore all .env files; commit only *.example templates so contributors
# know what to set. Real values live in:
#   - Netlify build env (VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY) — used by prod deploys
#   - GitHub Actions secrets — used by CI Playwright builds
#   - .env.local (gitignored) — used for local dev
.env
.env.*
!.env*.example
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
test-results/
playwright-report/
